# Prisma
# src/generated/ - MUST be committed for Vercel deployment
# but stale temp files from interrupted `prisma generate` runs must not be
*.tmp[0-9]*


# Prisma emits a node_modules folder INSIDE its generated client, and that
# client is committed on purpose so Vercel can bundle it (see next.config.ts
# outputFileTracingIncludes). The recursive node_modules/ rule above would
# swallow it, so it is excepted here explicitly.
#
# Before U6 this was not needed: node_modules was root-anchored as
# /node_modules and never matched a nested path. Moving the apps into apps/*
# forced the rule to become recursive, which caught this as a side effect.
!src/generated/**/node_modules/
!apps/*/src/generated/**/node_modules/
